## Update 6.8

- Mappacks can now have included/excluded tags to search for when preparing maps (Thanks teggot for contributing this!)
- Plugins disabled by Competitive Patch will now be reenabled after the game ends (Thanks to ArEyeses for fixing this issue)
- Configuration warnings can now be properly disabled (contributed by henrio6)
- Fixed Rally powerup edge wrapping in some edge cases (contributed by Simber)
- Fixed match state not being reset upon creating a new room
